				<r3d:description language="eng">Projects in the International Scientific Continental Drilling Program (ICDP) produce large amounts of data. Since the start of ICDP, data sharing has played an important part in ICDP projects, and the ICDP Operational Support Group, which provides the infrastructure for data capturing for many ICDP projects, has facilitated dissemination of data within project groups. With the online Scientific Drilling Database (SDDB; http://www.scientificdrilling.org), ICDP and GFZ Helmholtz Centre for Geosciences, Germany created a platform for the public dissemination of drilling data</r3d:description>
